{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0614_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0614_1000_p", "source_sha256": "836ee7bb02da94c9b82a64b9bf5c023869648efb6e34707aa98e61aed18195c0", "ja": "（今日は舞台『昏き星、遠い月』のリハーサル。\n順調に進んでいて、今はちょうど昴の出番だ）", "zh": "（今天是舞台剧《昏暗之星，遥远之月》的彩排。进展很顺利，现在正好轮到昴上场。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0614_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0614_1001_047sub", "source_sha256": "0566be715af44d580c963b2d9bc52f00e1c10a4c4bb81c557b26e6a9e4f845fa", "ja": "綺麗ごとじゃ腹は満たせねぇよ、エドガー。\nこの世界は弱肉強食だって、まだわかんねぇのか！", "zh": "光说漂亮话可填不饱肚子，埃德加。你还不明白这个世界是弱肉强食的吗！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0614_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0614_1002_047sub", "source_sha256": "3a377798b6221b5063442c1fbb126f489df7f2b468ff43f1777c224e6e10085d", "ja": "『正しさ』なんか求めんなよ！　一緒に生きようぜ。\nどんな手使ってでも……生き延びりゃいいんだ！", "zh": "别追求什么“正确”了！一起活下去吧。\n不管用什么手段……只要能活下来就行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0614_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0614_1003_047sub", "source_sha256": "2869a58160e95a8ece7a9ea07bf9a649134039320a73c49397eb3dcee9b9806a", "ja": "……そうかよ。クソッ、ならもういい。お前が\n何と言おうと、オレ達はオレ達で生きていくだけだ！", "zh": "……这样啊。可恶，那就随你便吧。不管你\n说什么，我们都会按照自己的方式活下去！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0614_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0614_1004_p", "source_sha256": "9a6b7262a38d83be69175c485d5ad92fcb0f56171e07fcbe88b5829cf9629554", "ja": "お疲れ、昴。いい演技だったぞ……\nって、どうした？　少し顔が暗いな。", "zh": "辛苦了，昴。演得很棒啊……\n呃，怎么了？你的表情好像有点阴沉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0614_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0614_1005_047sub", "source_sha256": "8668b5cb05278061d5eab4dda102c7e625fecd2b1006e25cf7364a764715f690", "ja": "あ、{$P$}……。ごめん、\n今のシーンのこと考えてたら、なんか考えちゃってさ。", "zh": "啊，{$P$}……对不起，\n想着刚才的场景，就忍不住想了些事情。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0614_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0614_1006_047sub", "source_sha256": "6da8b2fa70903a9762822ee43649c6c5afb29c34ff166349a52d6ecc95226cd0", "ja": "ルカはエドガーにあんなコト言ったけど……。\n本当は、ずっと仲良くしたかったんじゃないかって。", "zh": "露卡虽然对埃德加说了那种话……但我在想，她其实一直都想和他好好相处吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0614_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0614_1007_p", "source_sha256": "2acbd6a2f7b4f2901c669e21de09dfb3461f5daf022d6a1e6cd150476257e965", "ja": "ふたりが口論した事で、\n決定的に道が分かれるんだったな。", "zh": "两人因为争吵，最终走上了不同的道路。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0614_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0614_1008_047sub", "source_sha256": "2b8496ad9b54919e8baafefc909c45e7694dda76811f0d79f25910322be1820d", "ja": "うん……。\nでもさ、昔はすっげー仲よかったじゃん？", "zh": "嗯……。\n不过，你们以前不是关系特别好吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0614_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0614_1009_047sub", "source_sha256": "fed5c51de6dee8521fbc4f40cef99b1228cf979b5c7cbfc9afd94aed29a6a38c", "ja": "だからルカも、あんな風に言っちゃったけど……\n本当は、別れたくなかったんじゃないかなって。", "zh": "所以，虽然琉佳说了那样的话……\n但我觉得，她其实并不想分手吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0614_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0614_1010_p", "source_sha256": "12f25d0e7b6147428f7add667039613d3f9f312a3cd358fb2d164e60fc7183b0", "ja": "「一緒に生きよう」って言ってたくらいだしな。\nそうだと思うよ。", "zh": "毕竟都说过“一起活下去”这种话了。\n我也觉得是这样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0614_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0614_1011_p", "source_sha256": "c24d7c9e8f68df076b0f5c893c77d36655dfa37ca8157558cb7d516f62fd1260", "ja": "もしエドガーが、ずっとルカ達と一緒にいたら。\n違う未来があったかもしれないしな。", "zh": "要是艾德加一直和卢卡他们在一起的话，\n说不定就会有不一样的未来了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0614_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0614_1012_047sub", "source_sha256": "068dbcfbfe72f6e15aa4117054a205e74b44c8188461fbcfd263222dd5c5892f", "ja": "そうなんだよ！　スラムで、悪い大人達に\nいいように使われて、それでもさ……。", "zh": "就是这样啊！在贫民窟里，被那些坏大人们随意利用，可即便如此……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0614_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0614_1013_047sub", "source_sha256": "f22994adc9e7ab032e4f27b086a4d95ae373d3442da24737fa6e3cb562255a35", "ja": "ルカがギリギリ踏ん張れてたのは、\nやっぱエドガーとか仲間がいたからだと思うんだ……。", "zh": "我觉得卢卡之所以能勉强坚持下来，果然还是因为有埃德加和伙伴们在身边吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0614_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0614_1014_047sub", "source_sha256": "0a7bbfde088786f8263885f6f829dd7ea4d495a3cfef95e028fcdb7b80d27366", "ja": "だから……なんつーか、モヤモヤするんだよな。\nここで別れなきゃ、ルカだって……って。", "zh": "所以……怎么说呢，总觉得心里堵得慌。\n要是没有在这里分开的话，露卡她也……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0614_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0614_1015_p", "source_sha256": "361709103888a58bd873f1f026f34a37966e1326bd399d5ce321df2d9ceb6186", "ja": "……この後に演じるのは、まさにその場面だな。\nエドガー達を襲ってクリスに返り討ちに遭うシーンだ。", "zh": "……接下来要演的，正是那个场面呢。\n袭击埃德加他们，却反被克里斯击败的那场戏。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0614_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0614_1016_p", "source_sha256": "8d4dd70af250192e23ab702aa26bdcf59c76eabd0dab1e52987a9dfb75f957f4", "ja": "気持ち的にも、大変だと思うけど……\n大丈夫そうか？", "zh": "我觉得在心理上应该也挺难受的……\n你还撑得住吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0614_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0614_1017_047sub", "source_sha256": "41a59ba2638d4ca80fe34cecf7fbd5770633b46f7e1ace7c51da6c0d118c0cc2", "ja": "んー……まぁ、それがルカの選んだ道だしな。\nキツいけど、それでも……しっかり演じてくるよ。", "zh": "嗯——……嘛，毕竟那是卢卡选择的道路啊。\n虽然挺难受的，但即使这样……我也会好好演出来的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0614_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0614_1018_047sub", "source_sha256": "591c2e1d9beec43642e33f638c8f0cdab8bd3036e2283e8012008c747ca20cd2", "ja": "それに、こうやって考えるのも悪くないと思うんだ。\nルカだって、後悔してるところもあっただろうし。", "zh": "而且，我觉得像这样思考一番也不错。\n露卡她，应该也有后悔的地方吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0614_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0614_1019_047sub", "source_sha256": "47c53dcac6a1a3ec3fe52e7621db857281eb419c2c3ee9d0effac08712873d8f", "ja": "だから、このモヤモヤをぶつけたら……いいラストに\nなると思うんだ。……よし、がんばってくるよ！", "zh": "所以，把这份郁结倾注进去……我觉得会迎来一个美好的结局。\n……好，我去努力了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0614_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0614_1020_p", "source_sha256": "6874b0f82ac171066753ea9c98ce13f3faf722a92788c13a9b7f9667b7ae5beb", "ja": "（そうして披露された、ルカの最期……\n昴の演技は、胸を締めつけられるほど見事だった）", "zh": "（就这样呈现出的露卡的临终一幕……昴的演技精彩得让人胸口发紧）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
